<section id="tab-rate">
<div class="card">
<label>Meter type</label>
<select id="mt"><option value="m">Metric (m³)</option><option value="i">Imperial (ft³)</option></select>
<div class="row"><div><label>Test volume</label>
<select id="vol"><option value="0.01">0.01 m³</option><option value="0.02">0.02 m³</option><option value="0.05">0.05 m³</option><option value="0.1">0.1 m³</option><option value="c">Custom…</option></select></div>
<div><label>Time taken (seconds)</label><input id="sec" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 96"></div></div>
<div class="sw noprint"><b id="swd">0.0 s</b><button class="btn" id="sws">Start</button><button class="btn alt" id="swr">Reset</button></div><p class="note">Stop the stopwatch to fill in the time automatically.</p>
<div class="row"><div><label>Calorific value (MJ/m³)</label><input id="cv" type="number" inputmode="decimal" value="39.5" step="0.1"></div>
<div><label>Data plate input (kW, optional)</label><input id="plate" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="e.g. 24"></div></div>
<div class="res">
<div><small>Gross heat input</small><span class="big" id="gross">–</span> kW</div>
<div><small>Net heat input</small><span class="big" id="net">–</span> kW</div>
<div><small>Gas rate</small><b id="m3h">–</b> m³/h</div>
<div><small>Gas rate</small><b id="ft3h">–</b> ft³/h</div></div>
<p id="cmp" class="note"></p>
<p class="note">Gross kW = m³/h × CV ÷ 3.6. Net = gross ÷ 1.11 (natural gas). Use the CV from the customer’s gas bill. Indicative only: always follow manufacturer’s instructions and Gas Safe requirements.</p>
</div></section>

