<section id="tab-tt" class="hide">
<div class="card"><b>1. Installation volume (IV)</b><p class="note">IGEM/UP/1B Edition 4. Pipe values already include 10% for fittings.</p>
<div id="ttr"><div class="item" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 84px 36px"><select data-r="0" data-k="p"><option value="0">Copper 15mm</option><option value="1" selected="">Copper 22mm</option><option value="2">Copper 28mm</option><option value="3">Copper 35mm</option><option value="4">Steel ½"</option><option value="5">Steel ¾"</option><option value="6">Steel 1"</option><option value="7">Steel 1¼"</option></select><input data-r="0" data-k="l" type="number" inputmode="decimal" value="2" placeholder="m"><button class="btn alt" style="margin:0;padding:0" data-rd="0">✕</button></div><div class="item" style="grid-template-columns:1fr 84px 36px"><select data-r="1" data-k="p"><option value="0" selected="">Copper 15mm</option><option value="1">Copper 22mm</option><option value="2">Copper 28mm</option><option value="3">Copper 35mm</option><option value="4">Steel ½"</option><option value="5">Steel ¾"</option><option value="6">Steel 1"</option><option value="7">Steel 1¼"</option></select><input data-r="1" data-k="l" type="number" inputmode="decimal" value="6" placeholder="m"><button class="btn alt" style="margin:0;padding:0" data-rd="1">✕</button></div></div><button class="btn alt" id="ttadd">+ Add pipe run</button>
<label>Meter in the test section</label><select id="ttm"><option value="0">None (e.g. AECV only)</option><option value="1">G4 / U6 diaphragm (0.008 m³)</option><option value="2">E6 ultrasonic (0.0024 m³)</option><option value="3">U16 diaphragm (0.025 m³)</option><option value="4">Custom</option></select><input id="ttmc" class="hide" type="number" inputmode="decimal" placeholder="Meter volume m³" step="0.0001">
<div class="res"><div><small>Total IV</small><b id="tiv">0.00163</b> m³</div><div><small>Purge volume (1.5 × IV)</small><b id="tpv">0.00244</b> m³</div></div></div>
<div class="card"><b>2. Test result</b>
